en:
...I can't think about that now.
When I opened the textbook, the answers to the exam were written inside.
I copied them down, one after another.{p}

Once I'm enrolled, I'll visit the newspaper club right away.
And I'll treat Hino the way an obedient junior would.
If he's going to put on an act, I have to play along.{p}

"...I'll show you around.
You came to take the exam, didn't you?
You probably don't know much about this school."{p}

It was Arai.
"Is that so? Then please tell me all about it."
"Yes..."{p}

It was Iwashita.
I walked down the hallway without a word.
Before long, I reached the end of the hallway.{p}

"Where are you going?"
From behind me came another voice, a nasal one.
That's Kazama.{p}

"Did you come for the exam? Don't worry, I'm sure you passed.
I was nervous too when I took my entrance exams, but it worked out somehow."
It was Hosoda.{p}

"You came to take the exam, right? Me too.
I hope we both passed."
"Yes."{p}
